@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics for Clients" as FAFR003
  usecase "CFR002: Receive Alerts about Anomalous Transactions" as CFR002
  usecase "CFR004: Personalized Recommendations Based on Financial Profile" as CFR004
  usecase "SFR015: Request Predictive Intervention Analyses from AI Component" as SFR015
  usecase "AIFR003: Generate Spending Limit Alerts for Users" as AIFR003
  usecase "CFR006: View Spending Limit Alerts When Exceeding Thresholds" as CFR006
  usecase "SFR007: Request Investment Opportunity Analysis from AI Component" as SFR007
  usecase "AIFR004: Generate Investment Opportunities Based on Risk Profiles" as AIFR004
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions Based on Historical Data and Trends" as CFR003
  usecase "SFR012: Generate Client Dashboards with Financial Information" as SFR012
  usecase "AIFR007: Generate Contextualized News Insights for Users' Portfolios" as AIFR007
  usecase "CFR008: Access Personalized Dashboard to Monitor Finances" as CFR008
  usecase "SFR013: Generate Client Alerts Based on Predefined Conditions" as SFR013
  usecase "AIFR009: Generate Predictive Insights for Financial Planning" as AIFR009
  usecase "CFR010: Manage Relationship with Financial Advisors Including Data Sharing Permissions" as CFR010
}

actor Client as c
actor SystemAdmin as sa
actor FinancialAdvisor as fa

c --> CFR001 : View financial insights dashboard  
sa --> SAFR001 : Manage analysis parameters  
fa --> FAFR003 : View predictive analytics for clients  

c --> CFR002 : Receive alerts about anomalous transactions  
c --> CFR004 : Personalized recommendations based on profile  
c --> SFR015 : Request predictive intervention analyses from AI component  
sa --> AIFR008 : Generate client predictive insights (not directly used here)  

fa --> FAFR002 : View client intervention alerts for proactively assisting clients  
fa --> FAFR004 : Configure analysis parameters per segment  
c --> CFR011 : Send feedback to improve system outputs  

sfr005: System must request spending limit alerts from AI component (not directly used here)  
aifr003: AI generates spending limit alerts when thresholds exceeded  
c --> AIFR006: Generate anomaly transaction alerts for compliance (not required in this context)

c --> SFR012 : View investment opportunities based on risk profile and ESG preferences  

sfr007: System requests investment opportunity analysis from AI component  
aifr004: AI generates suitable investments per user's criteria  
c --> AIFR005: Generate investment opportunities aligned with Modern Portfolio Theory (not directly used here)  

cfro12: Client wants to view spending limit alerts when exceeding thresholds  
sfr008: System requests anomaly transaction alerts from AI component for compliance checks  
aifr006: AI generates alerts based on pattern recognition and FinCEN requirements  

c --> CFR003 : View financial predictions (based on history + trends)  
cfro14: Client wants to view client analytics, which is part of SFR012's output? Maybe not directly a use case here. 

sfr019: System maintains historical record for trend analysis and improvement  

c --> CFR008 : Access personalized dashboard (already covered by SFR012)  
cfro13: Client wants to manage data sharing with advisors, which is part of client relationship management

@enduml